# Reports — a pure output directory, generated at runtime by ExportService and by
# mutation runs. Nothing here is source, so it is safe to `rm -rf reports` when
# cleaning up generated PDFs/workbooks/mutation.html. The CJK font that used to
# live here (and forced a whitelist exception) now lives in assets/fonts/, which
# is tracked normally.
#
# No .gitkeep exception: the directory is created by ExportService's constructor
# and by the mutation reporter, so a fresh clone simply does not have it until
# something writes. Carrying an empty tracked file to reserve the name was the
# habit from when the font lived here.
reports/

